  "notes": [
    "A hard-coded #2563EB (Tailwind v3 blue-600) appears 8 times (AssetDirectoryPage, AssetModal, AssetDetailView, EmptyCarrierProfile); the v4 token is #155dfc. TO CONFIRM: replace with bg-blue-600.",
    "text-muted (slate-400) fails 4.5:1 on white and slate-50; it is used on 10-11 px labels. Recommended fix: use slate-500 for any text.",
